### Budget API Testing


### Base URL

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionToken = rv3mOZk-7LSrIHw_5g6QC3YsoefvJmixYql2KSyFoIc=


### ============================================


### Authentication


### ============================================


### Login

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-email@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}


### Register

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### Logout

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### ============================================


### Budget - Savings Rate (TESTING PERIOD FIX)


### ============================================


### Get Savings Rate (Current Month - should use tracking period)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/stats/savings-rate HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### Get Savings Rate (Custom Period - Jan 15 to Feb 17)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/stats/savings-rate?start_date=2026-01-15&end_date=2026-02-17 HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### Get Savings Rate (Before tracking start - should auto-adjust to Jan 15)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/stats/savings-rate?start_date=2025-12-01&end_date=2026-02-17 HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### Get Savings Rate (Full tracking period to now)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/stats/savings-rate?start_date=2026-01-15&end_date=2026-02-17 HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


