### ============================================


### Budget - Income


### ============================================


### List Incomes

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/incomes?limit=20&offset=0 HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### Get Income by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/incomes/{income_id} HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### Create Income

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/incomes HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 3000.00,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "date": "2026-02-15",
  "description": "Salary - February",
  "recurring_type": null
}


### ============================================


### Budget - Expenses


### ============================================


### List Expenses

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses?limit=20&offset=0 HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### Get Expense by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses/{expense_id} HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### Create Expense

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/expenses HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "PHP",
  "description": "Groceries",
  "expense_date": "2026-02-17",
  "notes": "Weekly grocery shopping",
  "priority_group_id": "need-priority-group-id-here"
}


