### ============================================


### User Info


### ============================================


### Get Current User (includes tracking_start_date and money_baseline)

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Cookie: session_token={{sessionToken}}


### ============================================


### Testing Notes


### ============================================

# How to use this file:
# 1. Login using the Login request to get a session_token cookie
# 2. Copy the session_token value from the response cookies
# 3. Update @sessionToken at the top of this file
# 4. Run any request - the Cookie header will be automatically set
# # Expected Results After Fix:
# - Savings Rate should show period-based calculation (not cumulative)
# - Income/expenses only counted from tracking_start_date forward
# - Excluded income (before Jan 15) should not affect calculations
# # To verify baseline:
# - Check /api/auth/me for tracking_start_date and money_baseline fields
# - money_baseline should be your calculated Jan 15 baseline
# - tracking_start_date should be 2026-01-15
